 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology",
 "title": "SS32B to SS320B: 3 A Schottky barrier rectifiers, 20 V to 200 V, in SMB (DO-214AA)",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A family of nine single Schottky rectifiers in the SMB (DO-214AA) surface-mount package, rated 3 A average forward current and 80 A peak surge, with reverse ratings from 20 V (SS32B) to 200 V (SS320B). Forward voltage at 3 A rises with the voltage rating, from 0.55 V maximum on the 20-40 V parts to 0.95 V on the 150-200 V parts. Intended uses named for it are low-voltage high-frequency inverters, freewheeling, DC/DC converters and reverse-polarity protection. SS310B is the 100 V part.",
