  {
   "topic": "Uses",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Named applications: low-voltage high-frequency inverters, freewheeling, DC/DC converters and reverse-polarity protection."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Construction and assembly",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Surface-mount SMB (DO-214AA) body with built-in strain relief, suited to automated placement. Moisture sensitivity level 1 to J-STD-020, with a lead-free reflow peak of 260 °C. The mold compound is rated UL 94V-0 for flammability and is RoHS-compliant and halogen-free. Terminals are solder plated and solderable to MIL-STD-750, Method 2026."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Polarity",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "A band on the body marks the cathode end (pin 1). Each part is marked with its part number."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Forward current rating",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The 3.0 A IF(AV) rating applies to a 60 Hz sine wave into a resistive load, referred to lead temperature; Fig.1 gives the derating with lead temperature."
  }
